      "id": "city-1",
      "image": null,
      "text": "There exists a city you can only reach by falling asleep with your shoes on. Before you go, I must advise you of a few rules.",
      "secs": null,
      "style": {
        "look": "tiktok",
        "pos": "low",
        "size": 1
      },
      "live": {
        "scene": "the-city-you-reach-asleep",
        "sceneName": "The City You Reach Asleep",
        "shot": "1 the city",
        "frozen": null,
        "poster": null
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "city-2",
      "image": null,
      "text": "Rule one: the streetlamps there lean down to look at you. Let them. The ones that don't lean are not streetlamps.",
      "secs": null,
      "style": {
        "look": "tiktok",
        "pos": "top",
        "size": 1
      },
      "live": {
        "scene": "the-city-you-reach-asleep",
        "sceneName": "The City You Reach Asleep",
        "shot": "2 the lamps lean down to look",
        "frozen": null,
        "poster": null
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "city-3",
      "image": null,
      "text": "Rule two: the shops sell hours in jars. Never buy more than one. The rest belong to someone, and they will come for them.",
      "secs": null,
      "style": {
        "look": "tiktok",
        "pos": "top",
        "size": 1
      },
      "live": {
        "scene": "the-city-you-reach-asleep",
        "sceneName": "The City You Reach Asleep",
        "shot": "3 hours in jars",
        "frozen": null,
        "poster": null
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "city-4",
      "image": null,
      "text": "Rule three: if you meet someone with strange proportions wearing your face, don't speak. They're waiting to hear how you do it.",
      "secs": null,
      "style": {
        "look": "tiktok",
        "pos": "top",
        "size": 1
      },
      "live": {
        "scene": "the-city-you-reach-asleep",
        "sceneName": "The City You Reach Asleep",
        "shot": "4 someone wearing your face",
        "frozen": null,
        "poster": null
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "city-5",
      "image": null,
      "text": "Rule four: the moon is much closer there. If it starts lowering itself toward the street, go indoors. Any door. Don't ask whose house it is.",
      "secs": null,
      "style": {
        "look": "tiktok",
        "pos": "top",
        "size": 1
      },
      "live": {
        "scene": "the-city-you-reach-asleep",
        "sceneName": "The City You Reach Asleep",
        "shot": "5 the moon is much closer",
        "frozen": null,
        "poster": null
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "city-6",
      "image": null,
      "text": "When you wake up, check your shoes. If they're muddy, you didn't come back alone.",
